* _no_bulk collapses every device bulk onto the cell's OWN VDD / VSS port, so
* in a header-gated row it asserts n-well = VDD_SW while the layout has the
* n-well on always-on VDD (addWellTap FILLBIASA10TH, globalNetConnect
